cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use blindspot in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "blindspot: Bayesian Spatiotemporal Surveillance Quality Monitoring"
version: 0.0.0.9000
abstract: >-
  Estimates district-level expected case detection rates using Bayesian
  spatiotemporal models (BYM2 via INLA) and classifies surveillance quality
  into operational response categories. The core output is a surveillance
  performance index (SPI) defined as the ratio of observed to model-estimated
  expected counts, with full posterior uncertainty quantification.
authors:
